    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125920/extras/efa576dad98480c7a489bf85a56e0a73.webp?t=1732878276\" width=600 height=59 /></span><br>Hope &amp; Elpis is a transforming roguelike deck-builder game that follows the journey of Hope, a novice mage, and Elpis, an ancient mage. Seal away enemies within the space of the mysterious ancient artifact, the 'Orb'. As you seal away evil spirits, the Orb provides powerful magic in return.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125920/extras/cbd598595a541e00376daf19bf767549.avif?t=1732878276\" width=600 height=387 /></span><br><strong>Transform into an ancient mage!!</strong><br>Use Hope's magic and Elpis' Orb magic in the right place at the right time. Elpis' powerful Orb magic comes with a price.<br><br><br><strong>Tile-based battles</strong><br>Outmaneuver your foes, unleash area-of-effect spells, and sometimes, the best defense is a well-timed offense.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125920/extras/efa576dad98480c7a489bf85a56e0a73.webp?t=1732878276\" width=600 height=59 /></span><br><strong>The power of various Orbs</strong><br>Strategically choose the power of the Orbs to be released. Hope &amp; Elpis can select and combine three powers to use powerful magic.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125920/extras/efa576dad98480c7a489bf85a56e0a73.webp?t=1732878276\" width=600 height=59 /></span><br>Hope &amp; Elpis is a transforming roguelike deck-builder game that follows the journey of Hope, a novice mage, and Elpis, an ancient mage. Seal away enemies within the space of the mysterious ancient artifact, the 'Orb'. As you seal away evil spirits, the Orb provides powerful magic in return.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125920/extras/cbd598595a541e00376daf19bf767549.avif?t=1732878276\" width=600 height=387 /></span><br><strong>Transform into an ancient mage!!</strong><br>Use Hope's magic and Elpis' Orb magic in the right place at the right time. Elpis' powerful Orb magic comes with a price.<br><br><br><strong>Tile-based battles</strong><br>Outmaneuver your foes, unleash area-of-effect spells, and sometimes, the best defense is a well-timed offense.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125920/extras/efa576dad98480c7a489bf85a56e0a73.webp?t=1732878276\" width=600 height=59 /></span><br><strong>The power of various Orbs</strong><br>Strategically choose the power of the Orbs to be released. Hope &amp; Elpis can select and combine three powers to use powerful magic.",
    "short_description": "Hope &amp; Elpis is a deck-builder roguelike where you play as a magical girl with two souls. Transform into the ancient mage Elpis, wielding Orbs to battle enemies. Learn diverse spells, unleash the Orbs' power, and seal calamities in Eden.",
